MCP Ruby SDK

The official Ruby SDK for Model Context Protocol servers and clients.
Detailed guides are available at https://ruby.sdk.modelcontextprotocol.io.

Features

* Build [MCP servers](https://ruby.sdk.modelcontextprotocol.io/server/) that
  expose tools, prompts, and resources to any MCP host

* Build [MCP clients](https://ruby.sdk.modelcontextprotocol.io/client/) that
  connect to any MCP server, with automatic lifecycle negotiation and OAuth
  2.1 authorization

* Speak every standard transport: stdio and Streamable HTTP (including SSE),
  with a Rails integration

* Cover the full protocol surface: server-to-client requests, multi
  round-trip requests, notifications, progress, logging, cancellation,
  completions, and pagination
